# Auto-deploy to brkmb.com

After any change that affects the live site (pages, components, data, styles, functions, public assets):

1. Run `npm run build` and fix failures before pushing.
2. Commit with a clear message (only when the user asked for changes or deploy).
3. Push to `origin main` — Cloudflare Pages deploys automatically from `main`.

Do not skip deploy when the user says to publish or expects changes on brkmb.com. Do not push secrets (`.env`, `.dev.vars`).
